1-35|Potion: Roll [[1d100]] on the Potions table.
36-50|Scroll: Roll [[1d100]] on the Spell List (p.100) to determine which spell the scroll holds.
51-90|Minor Charm: Roll [[1d100]] on the Minor Charms table.
91-100|Spellbook: Roll [[1d10]] to determine which spells are contained: (i-v) 2 x random spells from the Spell List, (vi-viii) 3 x random spells from the Spell List, (ix-x) The PCs have discovered an Old Magic Grimoire, containing an ancient and very powerful spell (p.240).